      <div type="clause" n="54">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 54</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf wiffæst wer hine forlicge be his agenre wylne, ðolie ðære ⁊ bete for hine sylfne wiþ Godd [⁊] wið men.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a married man commits adultery with his own slave, he shall lose her and make amends for himself both to God and to men.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif wiffæst wer hine forlicge be his agenre wylne, þolige þære ⁊ bete for hine sylfne wiþ God ⁊ wið men.</ab>
